# shellcheck shell=bash disable=SC2034 # sourced; the sourcing scripts use these
# The tag of theorem-labs/agent-infra's leak-check/ that sami-devbox holds in
# ~/.local/share/public-leak-check. devbox/sami-devbox-provision (step leakcheck) installs it as the
# tag's leak-check/INSTALL.md says; devbox/sami-devbox-check compares the installed files with the
# sha256 here. Sourced by both.
#
# To install a new tag: set LEAK_CHECK_PREV to the tag installed now, LEAK_CHECK_TAG and
# LEAK_CHECK_COMMIT to the new one, and LEAK_CHECK_HOME_SHA256 to the `sha256sum` lines of these
# four runtime files in the message that announced the tag (no ruleset protects the tags, so the provision
# compares the tag's files with them). Keep the file order.
LEAK_CHECK_TAG=leak-check-v35
LEAK_CHECK_PREV=leak-check-v33
LEAK_CHECK_COMMIT=f80e42473965c65e8d86be4adb193b97f32dde28
LEAK_CHECK_HOME_SHA256='b1fcb5fa4aaed2eb6aed8fe3f3e8c764376baa206098778191f274182d212a76  public-leak-check.sh
54f83a7c38fc2000b65d83eedbf31c2da87d05cd8edb2b5b28356404cc5d510f  public_leak_check.py
f49b59af3a66eec1dfe41aaf1661c51b52554c481c8a970ea7f2a67a76243268  README.md
c678157a24bb291ca876efdb3adf1b8c76bba859ffeb19da44fa20313156f430  must-pass-lines.txt'
# The pre-push hook's installer, FRAC's hook sweep, and the global hooks dispatcher of dispatch://BET-706
# R6 (install-global-hooks.sh and every file of global-hooks/), from the same tag, which step prepush
# installs in ~/.local/share/public-leak-check-hooks and sami-devbox-check reads. Same order rule; the
# names here are the files step prepush installs, and a line that is not `<sha256>  <file>` refuses.
